cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Computations for 'A local Yang-Baxter obstruction for the hard-square model'"
authors:
  - family-names: Ortega
    given-names: Gabriel
    affiliation: "Universidad de Chile"
abstract: >-
  Exact checks of the finite statements in the paper "A local Yang-Baxter
  obstruction for the hard-square model": the equations and polynomial
  certificates on the binary alphabet and on the hard-hexagon alphabet A_4,
  the calibration against the critical RSOS model, and the remaining finite
  computations listed in its Appendix A. Every proof in the paper can be read
  without the script, which only guards against arithmetic slips.
version: 1.0.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23892181
date-released: 2026-11-02
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/gabrielortegaproyectos/hard-square-yang-baxter-obstruction"
keywords:
  - hard-square model
  - hard-hexagon model
  - Yang-Baxter equation
  - restricted solid-on-solid models
  - computer-assisted verification
